WEBVTT

00:37:27.193 --> 00:37:31.760
ideas are being shared
from new technologies.

00:37:31.784 --> 00:37:35.762
The AI academic community
has been very, very open to sharing,

00:37:35.786 --> 00:37:38.291
because it's one of the very few sciences

00:37:38.315 --> 00:37:42.805
where the same data, the same algorithm
can give you the same result,

00:37:42.829 --> 00:37:45.622
so people believe each other's results

00:37:45.646 --> 00:37:49.217
and work is always built
on the shoulders of giants.

00:37:49.844 --> 00:37:53.117
And also, I think there are
a number of efforts,

00:37:53.141 --> 00:37:55.452
including the World Economic Forum,

00:37:55.476 --> 00:37:58.943
in which I am a co-chair
of the AI Council.

00:37:58.967 --> 00:38:01.601
There is partnership for AI